<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>网络安全等级保护智能体 · 机构端原型（V2 新导航）</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <!-- ===== 侧边导航（V2 新导航 I1–I8） ===== -->
  <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar__brand">
      <span class="logo">等</span>
      <div>等级保护智能体<small>机构端 · V2 导航</small></div>
    </div>
    <nav class="sidebar__nav">
      <div class="nav-group-title">业务办理</div>
      <a class="nav-item active" data-page="workbench"><span class="ico">▦</span><span class="label">I1 工作台</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item" data-page="filing"><span class="ico">▤</span><span class="label">I2 备案材料</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item" data-page="implement"><span class="ico">▥</span><span class="label">I3 实施管理</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item" data-page="report"><span class="ico">▧</span><span class="label">I4 测评报告</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item" data-page="ai"><span class="ico">✦</span><span class="label">I5 智能辅助</span><span class="tag-new">新</span></a>
      <div class="nav-group-title">基础与系统</div>
      <a class="nav-item" data-page="data"><span class="ico">◷</span><span class="label">I6 基础数据</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item" data-page="msg"><span class="ico">✉</span><span class="label">I7 消息中心</span><span class="tag-fix">预警</span></a>
      <a class="nav-item" data-page="account"><span class="ico">⚙</span><span class="label">I8 账号设置</span></a>
    </nav>
    <div class="sidebar__foot">江州市公安局网安支队 · 测评机构工作台</div>
  </aside>
  <div class="scrim" id="scrim"></div>

  <!-- ===== 主区 ===== -->
  <div class="main">
    <header class="topbar">
      <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn">☰</button>
      <div class="crumb" id="crumb">工作台</div>
      <div class="spacer"></div>
      <div class="gb" onclick="goto('flow')">⤢ 流程示意</div>
      <div class="bell" onclick="goto('msg')">🔔<span class="dot">3</span></div>
      <div class="avatar" id="avatarBtn">测</div>
      <div class="who"><b>杭州安安检测</b>测评机构</div>
    </header>

    <main class="content">

      <!-- ============ I1 工作台 ============ -->
      <section class="page active" id="p-workbench">
        <div class="page-head">
          <div><h1>工作台</h1><p>任务看板 · 待办提醒 · 数据概览</p></div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goto('ai')">＋ AI 智能辅助</button>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-grid">
          <div class="stat-card"><span class="bar b-blue"></span><div class="n">12</div><div class="l">待处理任务</div><div class="sub">其中 3 项今日到期</div></div>
          <div class="stat-card"><span class="bar b-teal"></span><div class="n">8</div><div class="l">进行中实施报备</div><div class="sub">2 项本月需完成</div></div>
          <div class="stat-card"><span class="bar b-warn"></span><div class="n">5</div><div class="l">本月测评报告</div><div class="sub">已提交 3 / 待审 2</div></div>
          <div class="stat-card"><span class="bar b-purple"></span><div class="n">2</div><div class="l">超期预警</div><div class="sub">需尽快处理</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi-grid">
          <div class="card card-pad">
            <div class="section-title">任务看板</div>
            <div class="task-list">
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-warn"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">XX政务云系统 — 备案材料审核确认</div><div class="m">上级已终审通过，待提交实施报备</div></div><div class="meta">今日到期</div></div>
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-blue"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">市医院HIS系统 — 测评报告补正</div><div class="m">监管退回：高风险项未整改闭环</div></div><div class="meta">剩 2 天</div></div>
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-teal"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">XX集团ERP — 实施报备录入</div><div class="m">计划变更剩余 2 次</div></div><div class="meta">剩 6 天</div></div>
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-purple"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">智慧校园平台 — 备案变更申请</div><div class="m">换机构复测，需前置实施报备审核</div></div><div class="meta">剩 9 天</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card card-pad">
            <div class="section-title">数据面板</div>
            <div class="row-2" style="margin-bottom:14px">
              <div><div class="mini-num" style="color:var(--c-primary-700)">36</div><div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">本年备案完成量</div></div>
              <div><div class="mini-num" style="color:var(--c-teal)">29</div><div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">本年测评完成量</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="section-title">临期提醒</div>
            <div class="task-list">
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-warn"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">已到期 1 项</div><div class="m">XX政务云系统备案</div></div></div>
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-blue"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">10 日内到期 3 项</div><div class="m">含 2 项测评报告</div></div></div>
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-teal"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">30 日内到期 5 项</div><div class="m">—</div></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-pad" style="margin-top:16px">
          <div class="section-title">快捷入口</div>
          <div class="quick-grid">
            <div class="quick" onclick="goto('filing')"><span class="qi">▤</span><span>备案列表</span></div>
            <div class="quick" onclick="openModal('m-filing-add')"><span class="qi">＋</span><span>备案材料</span></div>
            <div class="quick" onclick="goto('implement')"><span class="qi">▥</span><span>实施管理</span></div>
            <div class="quick" onclick="goto('report')"><span class="qi">▧</span><span>测评报告</span></div>
            <div class="quick" onclick="goto('data')"><span class="qi">◷</span><span>单位 / 系统</span></div>
            <div class="quick" onclick="goto('ai')"><span class="qi">✦</span><span>智能体</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ I2 备案材料 ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-filing">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>备案材料</h1><p>备案材料 / 备案变更 / 备案注销 一览与办理</p></div></section>
        <div class="tabs" id="tabs-filing">
          <button class="tab active" data-tab="f-tab-1">备案材料<span class="cnt">36</span></button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="f-tab-2">备案变更<span class="cnt">4</span></button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="f-tab-3">备案注销<span class="cnt">1</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane active" id="f-tab-1">
          <div class="filter">
            <div class="field"><label>系统</label><input class="input" placeholder="输入系统名称"></div>
            <div class="field"><label>单位</label><input class="input" placeholder="输入单位名称"></div>
            <div class="field"><label>备案编号</label><input class="input" placeholder="如 3301xxxxx"></div>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" style="height:34px">查询</button>
            <button class="btn" style="height:34px">重置</button>
          </div>
          <div class="toolbar">
            <div class="left">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openModal('m-filing-add')">＋ 添加</button>
              <button class="btn">复制</button>
              <button class="btn">备案变更</button>
              <button class="btn">备案注销</button>
              <button class="btn">查看</button>
              <button class="btn">重发</button>
              <button class="btn btn-danger">删除</button>
              <button class="btn btn-primary">确认提交审核</button>
            </div>
            <div class="right"><button class="btn">⚙ 列设置</button><button class="btn">⟳</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="tbl">
              <thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>系统</th><th>单位</th><th>备案编号</th><th>备案证号</th><th>安全保护等级</th><th>审核状态</th><th>文件状态</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>1</td><td>XX政务云系统</td><td>江州市大数据局</td><td>3301-0001</td><td>3301-0001-A</td><td>第三级</td><td><span class="badge b-pass">已通过</span></td><td><span class="badge b-info">已上传</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="openModal('m-filing-detail')">详情</span><span class="link">变更</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td>2</td><td>市医院HIS系统</td><td>江州市第一医院</td><td>3301-0002</td><td>—</td><td>第三级</td><td><span class="badge b-wait">待终审</span></td><td><span class="badge b-info">已上传</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="openModal('m-filing-detail')">详情</span><span class="link">复制</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td>3</td><td>智慧校园平台</td><td>江州学院</td><td>3301-0003</td><td>—</td><td>第二级</td><td><span class="badge b-back">已退回</span></td><td><span class="badge b-info">已上传</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="openModal('m-filing-detail')">详情</span><span class="link">重发</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td>4</td><td>XX集团ERP</td><td>XX集团有限公司</td><td>3301-0004</td><td>—</td><td>第三级</td><td><span class="badge b-wait">待初审</span></td><td><span class="badge b-warn">校验中</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="openModal('m-filing-detail')">详情</span><span class="link">删除</span></td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="pager"><span>共 36 条</span><span class="pg">‹</span><span class="pg active">1</span><span class="pg">2</span><span class="pg">3</span><span class="pg">›</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="f-tab-2">
          <div class="table-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>系统</th><th>单位</th><th>变更类型</th><th>审核状态</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>智慧校园平台</td><td>江州学院</td><td>换机构复测</td><td><span class="badge b-wait">待初审</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link">详情</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td>2</td><td>XX政务云系统</td><td>江州市大数据局</td><td>系统扩容</td><td><span class="badge b-pass">已通过</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link">详情</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="f-tab-3">
          <div class="table-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>系统</th><th>单位</th><th>注销原因</th><th>审核状态</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>老旧OA系统</td><td>XX街道办</td><td>系统下线</td><td><span class="badge b-wait">待终审</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link">详情</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ I3 实施管理 ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-implement">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>实施管理</h1><p>实施报备录入、变更与历史记录</p></div></section>
        <div class="filter">
          <div class="field"><label>备案证</label><input class="input" placeholder="选择备案证"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>系统</label><input class="input" placeholder="输入系统名称"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>单位</label><input class="input" placeholder="输入单位名称"></div>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" style="height:34px">查询</button>
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar">
          <div class="left"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openModal('m-impl-add')">＋ 添加</button><button class="btn">查看</button></div>
          <div class="right"><button class="btn">⚙ 列设置</button><button class="btn">⟳</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table class="tbl">
            <thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>系统</th><th>单位</th><th>备案证号</th><th>测评开始</th><th>测评结束</th><th>实施状态</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>1</td><td>市医院HIS系统</td><td>江州市第一医院</td><td>3301-0002-A</td><td>2026-09-10</td><td>2026-09-20</td><td><span class="badge b-wait">待实施</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="openModal('m-impl-add')">录入</span><span class="link">查看</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>2</td><td>XX集团ERP</td><td>XX集团有限公司</td><td>3301-0004-A</td><td>2026-09-15</td><td>2026-09-25</td><td><span class="badge b-info">进行中</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link">查看</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>3</td><td>智慧校园平台</td><td>江州学院</td><td>3301-0003-A</td><td>2026-08-20</td><td>2026-08-30</td><td><span class="badge b-pass">已完成</span></td><td class="ops"><span class="link">查看</span></td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="hint">说明：实施计划变更最多 3 次；测评日 0 点前可修改，开始后仅能撤销（撤销后 15 天冷却）。</div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ I4 测评报告 ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-report">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>测评报告</h1><p>报告上传、导入与审核跟踪</p></div></section>
        <div class="tabs" id="tabs-report">
          <button class="tab active" data-tab="r-tab-1">报告列表<span class="cnt">29</span></button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="r-tab-2">未成功<span class="cnt">2</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane active" id="r-tab-1">
          <div class="toolbar">
            <div class="left">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goto('report-import')">⬆ 导入</button>
              <button class="btn">删除</button>
              <button class="btn">详情</button>
            </div>
            <div class="right"><button class="btn">导出</button><button class="btn">⚙ 列设置</button><button class="btn">⟳</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="tbl">
              <thead><tr><th>文件名</th><th>系统</th><th>单位</th><th>文件状态</th><th>文件进度</th><th>审核状态</th><th>失败原因</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><td>市医院HIS测评报告.pdf</td><td>市医院HIS系统</td><td>江州市第一医院</td><td><span class="badge b-info">已上传</span></td><td>100%</td><td><span class="badge b-back">已退回</span></td><td>高风险项未闭环</td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="openModal('m-report-detail')">详情</span><span class="link">删除</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td>XX集团ERP测评报告.pdf</td><td>XX集团ERP</td><td>XX集团有限公司</td><td><span class="badge b-info">已上传</span></td><td>100%</td><td><span class="badge b-wait">待初审</span></td><td>—</td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="openModal('m-report-detail')">详情</span></td></tr>
                <tr><td>智慧校园测评报告.pdf</td><td>智慧校园平台</td><td>江州学院</td><td><span class="badge b-info">已上传</span></td><td>100%</td><td><span class="badge b-pass">已通过</span></td><td>—</td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="openModal('m-report-detail')">详情</span></td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="pager"><span>共 29 条</span><span class="pg active">1</span><span class="pg">2</span><span class="pg">3</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="r-tab-2">
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>文件名</th><th>失败原因</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>老旧OA测评报告.pdf</td><td>网络超时，文件未完整上传</td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="toast('已重新提交')">重发</span><span class="link">删除</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td>XX街道办测评报告.pdf</td><td>文件损坏，解析失败</td><td class="ops"><span class="link" onclick="toast('已重新提交')">重发</span><span class="link">删除</span></td></tr>
            </tbody></table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ I4-子 导入测评报告 ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-report-import">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>导入测评报告</h1><p>按标准命名分区上传，关联备案编号 / 单位 / 系统</p></div></section>
        <div class="filter">
          <div class="field" style="flex:1"><label>备案编号 *</label><input class="input" placeholder="选择备案编号"></div>
          <div class="field" style="flex:1"><label>单位 *</label><input class="input" placeholder="选择单位"></div>
          <div class="field" style="flex:1"><label>系统 *</label><input class="input" placeholder="选择系统"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-pad">
          <div class="section-title">报告文件（必传）</div>
          <div class="up-grid">
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>① 报告文件 <span class="req-star">*</span></span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传 PDF / Word / Excel</div></div>
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>② 整改规划 <span class="req-star">*</span></span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传</div></div>
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>③ 等级测评结论 <span class="req-star">*</span></span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传</div></div>
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>④ 主要安全问题及整改建议 <span class="req-star">*</span></span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传</div></div>
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>⑤ 报告封面+基本信息表+声明 <span class="req-star">*</span></span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传</div></div>
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>⑥ 测评结论扩展表（云计算）</span><span class="badge b-gray">非必传</span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传</div></div>
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>⑦ 测评结论扩展表（大数据）</span><span class="badge b-gray">非必传</span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传</div></div>
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>⑧ 重大风险隐患整改建议</span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传</div></div>
            <div class="up-card"><div class="uh"><span>⑨ 其他文件</span></div><div class="upload">＋ 点击上传</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hint">图片 image7 还原：报告文件、整改规划、等级测评结论、主要安全问题及整改建议、报告封面+基本信息表+声明 为必传；云计算/大数据扩展表、重大风险隐患整改建议、其他文件为选填。未上传成功记录见"未成功"列表，可重发。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="right"><button class="btn" onclick="goto('report')">返回列表</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="toast('报告已提交，进入预审')">确认导入</button></div></div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ I5 智能辅助（新） ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-ai">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>智能辅助</h1><p>AI 录入助手 · 智能问答 · 审核意见查收（承载功能清单 3.1.x）</p></div></section>
        <div class="tabs" id="tabs-ai">
          <button class="tab active" data-tab="a-tab-1">智能问答</button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="a-tab-2">AI 录入助手</button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="a-tab-3">审核意见查收</button>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane active" id="a-tab-1">
          <div class="card card-pad">
            <div class="section-title">对话</div>
            <div class="chat">
              <div class="bubble bot">您好，我是等级保护智能助手。您可以问我：定级标准、备案流程、材料准备要点等。</div>
              <div class="bubble me">第三级系统备案需要准备哪些材料？</div>
              <div class="bubble bot">第三级系统备案通常需要：
                <ul><li>备案表（系统基本情况、定级报告）</li><li>网络安全建设整改方案</li><li>测评报告（实施后）</li><li>单位资质与负责人信息</li></ul>
                建议在"备案材料"中先完成 AI 预审再提交。</div>
            </div>
            <div class="chat-input"><input class="input" placeholder="输入问题，回车发送…"><button class="btn btn-primary">发送</button></div>
            <div class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px">常用模板</div>
            <div class="template-grid">
              <div class="tpl"><div class="tt">网络安全基本信息</div><div class="td">Ops 运维类</div></div>
              <div class="tpl"><div class="tt">被测单位信息</div><div class="td">Ops 运维类</div></div>
              <div class="tpl"><div class="tt">测评报告历史对比</div><div class="td">Ops 分析类</div></div>
              <div class="tpl"><div class="tt">未整改漏洞清单</div><div class="td">Ops 分析类</div></div>
              <div class="tpl"><div class="tt">区域测评报告统计</div><div class="td">监管类</div></div>
              <div class="tpl"><div class="tt">＋ 新建会话</div><div class="td">多会话并行</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="a-tab-2">
          <div class="card card-pad">
            <div class="section-title">AI 自动录入</div>
            <p class="muted">上传历史备案材料 / 测评报告（PDF、Word、Excel），AI 模型自动抽取字段并回填到备案、实施、测评表单，支持人工复核修正。</p>
            <div class="upload" style="margin-top:10px">＋ 拖拽或点击上传材料，AI 将自动抽取字段</div>
            <div class="hint">例如：上传 ZIP 备案包后，AI 自动识别"系统名称 / 安全保护等级 / 单位 / IP 资产"并填充到备案录入表单，减少手工录入错误。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="a-tab-3">
          <div class="card card-pad">
            <div class="section-title">审核意见查收</div>
            <div class="task-list">
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-back"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">市医院HIS系统 — 测评报告退回</div><div class="m">监管意见：高风险项（SQL 注入）未整改闭环，请补充整改证明后重提</div></div><div class="meta">查看</div></div>
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-warn"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">智慧校园平台 — 备案变更退回</div><div class="m">监管意见：复测前置条件"实施报备审核通过"未满足</div></div><div class="meta">查看</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ I6 基础数据 ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-data">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>基础数据</h1><p>测评人员与被测单位信息维护</p></div></section>
        <div class="tabs" id="tabs-data">
          <button class="tab active" data-tab="d-tab-1">测评人员</button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="d-tab-2">被测单位</button>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane active" id="d-tab-1">
          <div class="toolbar"><div class="left"><button class="btn btn-primary">＋ 新增</button><button class="btn">编辑</button><button class="btn">删除</button></div></div>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>姓名</th><th>工号</th><th>资质</th><th>归属机构</th><th>在办任务</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td>张明</td><td>T-001</td><td>高级测评师</td><td>杭州安安检测</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>李华</td><td>T-002</td><td>测评师</td><td>杭州安安检测</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="d-tab-2">
          <div class="toolbar"><div class="left"><button class="btn btn-primary">＋ 新增</button><button class="btn">编辑</button></div></div>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>单位名称</th><th>信用代码</th><th>单位类型</th><th>所属系统数</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td>江州市第一医院</td><td>9133xxxx</td><td>医疗卫生</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>XX集团有限公司</td><td>9133yyyy</td><td>企业</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ I7 消息中心（预警消息为新补入口） ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-msg">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>消息中心</h1><p>消息公告 · 预警消息 · 消息通知</p></div></section>
        <div class="tabs" id="tabs-msg">
          <button class="tab active" data-tab="m-tab-1">消息公告</button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="m-tab-2">预警消息<span class="cnt">2</span></button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="m-tab-3">消息通知</button>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane active" id="m-tab-1">
          <div class="card card-pad">
            <div class="task-list">
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-blue"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">【系统公告】2026 年第四季度测评集中报送通知</div><div class="m">发布于 09-10 · 置顶</div></div><span class="badge b-info">公告</span></div>
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-purple"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">【任务通知】市医院HIS系统报告已退回，请查收</div><div class="m">发布于 09-09</div></div><span class="badge b-purple">任务</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="hint">管理员可设置接收方式：短信 / 邮件 / 站内信。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="m-tab-2">
          <div class="card card-pad">
            <div class="section-title">预警消息（新补导航入口）</div>
            <div class="task-list">
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-warn"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">任务超期预警 · XX政务云系统备案</div><div class="m">已到期 1 天，将推送至相关成员</div></div><button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="toast('预警已处理')">处理</button></div>
              <div class="task"><span class="pri b-danger"></span><div class="body"><div class="t">材料异常预警 · 老旧OA测评报告</div><div class="m">识别到文件格式错误 / 过期</div></div><button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="toast('预警已处理')">处理</button></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="m-tab-3">
          <div class="card card-pad"><div class="task-list">
            <div class="task"><div class="body"><div class="t">备案材料审核状态更新：智慧校园平台 → 已退回</div><div class="m">09-09 14:20</div></div><span class="badge b-gray">未读</span></div>
            <div class="task"><div class="body"><div class="t">实施报备审核通过：XX集团ERP</div><div class="m">09-08 10:05</div></div><span class="badge b-pass">已读</span></div>
          </div></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ I8 账号设置 ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-account">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>账号设置</h1><p>个人中心 · 登录日志</p></div></section>
        <div class="tabs" id="tabs-account">
          <button class="tab active" data-tab="ac-tab-1">个人中心</button>
          <button class="tab" data-tab="ac-tab-2">登录日志</button>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane active" id="ac-tab-1">
          <div class="card card-pad">
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="form-item"><label>姓名</label><input class="input" value="王测评"></div>
              <div class="form-item"><label>手机号</label><input class="input" value="138****0000"></div>
              <div class="form-item"><label>所属机构</label><input class="input" value="杭州安安检测技术有限公司" disabled></div>
              <div class="form-item"><label>邮箱</label><input class="input" value="wang@anxin.com"></div>
              <div class="form-item full"><label>修改密码</label><input class="input" type="password" placeholder="输入新密码（建议含大小写、字母、数字）"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:8px"><div class="right"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="toast('已保存')">保存</button></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane" id="ac-tab-2">
          <div class="table-wrap"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>IP</th><th>地点</th><th>结果</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td>2026-09-14 09:12</td><td>10.20.3.5</td><td>杭州</td><td><span class="badge b-pass">成功</span></td></tr><tr><td>2026-09-13 18:40</td><td>10.20.3.5</td><td>杭州</td><td><span class="badge b-pass">成功</span></td></tr><tr><td>2026-09-12 22:01</td><td>112.x.x.x</td><td>未知</td><td><span class="badge b-back">失败</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ 流程示意（全局） ============ -->
      <section class="page" id="p-flow">
        <div class="page-head"><div><h1>流程示意</h1><p>备案 → 实施 → 测评 核心业务流程</p></div></section>
        <div class="flow">
          <div class="step"><span class="node cur">备案材料</span></div><span class="arrow">→</span>
          <div class="step"><span class="node">系统预审</span></div><span class="arrow">→</span>
          <div class="step"><span class="node">初审</span></div><span class="arrow">→</span>
          <div class="step"><span class="node">终审</span></div><span class="arrow">→</span>
          <div class="step"><span class="node">实施报备</span></div><span class="arrow">→</span>
          <div class="step"><span class="node">测评实施</span></div><span class="arrow">→</span>
          <div class="step"><span class="node">报告审核</span></div><span class="arrow">→</span>
          <div class="step"><span class="node">完成归档</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-pad" style="margin-top:16px"><div class="hint">图片 image1 还原：三端（监管 / 机构 / 运营者）在线协同，全流程留痕。当前以机构端视角高亮"备案材料"环节。</div></div>
      </section>

    </main>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ 模态框 ============ -->
<!-- 添加备案材料 -->
<div class="modal-mask" id="m-filing-add">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal__head"><h3>添加备案材料</h3><button class="modal__close" onclick="closeModal('m-filing-add')">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal__body">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-item"><label>备案编号 <span class="req">*</span></label><div style="display:flex;gap:8px"><input class="input" placeholder="输入后点击校验"><button class="btn">⟳ 校验</button></div></div>
        <div class="form-item"><label>单位 <span class="req">*</span></label><input class="input" placeholder="关键词搜索单位"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-item full" style="margin-top:14px"><label>备案材料包（ZIP）</label>
        <div class="upload">＋ 点击上传 ZIP 包（含标准命名材料）</div>
        <div class="hint">建议按 portal 要求命名：报告文件 / 整改规划 / 等级测评结论 / 主要安全问题及整改建议 / 报告封面+基本信息表+声明。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal__foot"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal('m-filing-add')">取消</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="closeModal('m-filing-add');toast('已提交，进入数据预审')">确认提交审核</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 备案详情 -->
<div class="modal-mask" id="m-filing-detail">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal__head"><h3>备案材料详情 · 市医院HIS系统</h3><button class="modal__close" onclick="closeModal('m-filing-detail')">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal__body">
      <div class="detail-head"><span class="title">江州市第一医院</span><span class="badge b-wait">待终审</span></div>
      <dl class="dl">
        <dt>备案编号</dt><dd>3301-0002</dd>
        <dt>安全保护等级</dt><dd>第三级</dd>
        <dt>系统类型</dt><dd>医疗卫生业务系统</dd>
        <dt>文件状态</dt><dd><span class="badge b-info">已上传</span></dd>
      </dl>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top:16px">审核流转</div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-t">机构提交</div><div class="tl-m">2026-09-05 机构端录入并预审通过</div></div>
        <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-t">主管部门初审</div><div class="tl-m">2026-09-06 通过</div></div>
        <div class="tl-item"><div class="tl-t">终审（进行中）</div><div class="tl-m">2026-09-09 待市级终审</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal__foot"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal('m-filing-detail')">关闭</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 实施报备录入 -->
<div class="modal-mask" id="m-impl-add">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal__head"><h3>实施报备录入 · 市医院HIS系统</h3><button class="modal__close" onclick="closeModal('m-impl-add')">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal__body">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="form-item"><label>测评开始时间 <span class="req">*</span></label><input class="input" type="date" value="2026-09-10"></div>
        <div class="form-item"><label>测评结束时间 <span class="req">*</span></label><input class="input" type="date" value="2026-09-20"></div>
        <div class="form-item"><label>测评人员 <span class="req">*</span></label><input class="input" placeholder="选择测评师"></div>
        <div class="form-item"><label>联系方式</label><input class="input" placeholder="联系电话"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hint">备案材料通过审核的项目可快速录入备案编号与企业系统信息；实施计划变更最多 3 次。</div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal__foot"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal('m-impl-add')">取消</button><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="closeModal('m-impl-add');toast('实施报备已提交')">提交</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 报告详情 -->
<div class="modal-mask" id="m-report-detail">
  <div class="modal">
    <div class="modal__head"><h3>测评报告详情 · 市医院HIS测评报告.pdf</h3><button class="modal__close" onclick="closeModal('m-report-detail')">×</button></div>
    <div class="modal__body">
      <div class="detail-head"><span class="badge b-back">已退回</span><span class="muted">失败原因：高风险项未闭环</span></div>
      <div class="section-title">审核详情</div>
      <dl class="dl">
        <dt>AI 提取</dt><dd>资产清单 12 项 · 漏洞 8 项（高危 2）</dd>
        <dt>合规比对</dt><dd>不符合项 3（GB/T 22239-2019）</dd>
        <dt>风险定级</dt><dd><span class="badge b-warn">中高风险</span></dd>
        <dt>监管意见</dt><dd>高风险项（SQL 注入）未整改闭环，请补正后重提</dd>
      </dl>
      <div class="section-title" style="margin-top:16px">已上传文件</div>
      <div class="task-list">
        <div class="task"><div class="body"><div class="t">报告文件.pdf</div></div><span class="badge b-info">正常</span></div>
        <div class="task"><div class="body"><div class="t">整改规划.docx</div></div><span class="badge b-info">正常</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal__foot"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal('m-report-detail')">关闭</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="toast-wrap" id="toastWrap"></div>

<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
